    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<h3>Mission 1: Find the knowledge gap</h3><p>The proposed dry-season maize trial has three irrigation regimes, four blocks and one variety. Earlier research already establishes the general water–yield relationship.</p><p><strong>You are the research director. Which objective would make the most worthwhile contribution?</strong></p><p>[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p>
[[hint title="Need a clue?"]]<p>Ask what is already known, and what a new comparison could reveal that would change a decision.</p>[[/hint]]]]></text>
    </questiontext>
